- For input `[1, 2, 2, 4], 5`, the pairs are (1, 4) and (2, 3), but since 3 is not in the list, only (1, 4) is counted.
- For input `[1, 2, 3], 3`, the pairs are (1, 2) and (3, 0), but since 0 is not in the list, only (1, 2) is counted.
